# Where the Apps app gets apps from (docs/APPS.md), most trusted first: when
# two sources offer the same app, the first one wins.
#   owner/repo        a GitHub repository; its newest release must hold
#                     zeroos-apps.index and the packages it lists
#   https://...       any address that serves zeroos-apps.index the same way
# Apps run with full access to this device: only add sources you trust.
# The apps live in their own repository. The OS repository's releases
# still carry them for now, as a fallback.
hartj77-blip/CardPuter-Apps.4ME-U
